{
  "_comment": [
    "Worn down by a long time: an eroded landmass, and the ground and what stands on it leaning eroded, sheer",
    "where it broke and barren where it wore, never laid out fresh; what is built leans ruined; the wear on",
    "everything turned up and what stands set closer, as rubble does.",
    "",
    "It absorbed `battered`, which said the same of the whole Age (retired.json)."
